          "Can RCS messages include buttons and interactive actions?",
          "Yes. Businesses can include interactive buttons that allow customers to take actions such as confirming appointments, browsing products, tracking deliveries, or contacting support directly from the message.",
          "________________________________________",
          "What happens if a customer’s device does not support RCS?",
          "If a device or network does not support RCS messaging, the Vertex platform automatically sends the message as a standard SMS to ensure the communication still reaches the customer.",
          "________________________________________",
          "How can businesses get started with the Vertex RCS Platform?",
          "Businesses can integrate RCS messaging through the Vertex RCS Platform to create campaigns, send transactional messages, and manage customer interactions. Organizations can request a demo or contact the Vertex team to explore implementation options.",
          "________________________________________",
          "How does RCS compare with WhatsApp Business messaging?",
          "RCS and WhatsApp both support rich messaging experiences, but they operate on different channels. RCS works directly within the native messaging app on supported Android devices, while WhatsApp requires users to have the WhatsApp application installed.",
          "________________________________________",
          "Can RCS messaging be integrated with existing business systems?",
          "Yes. The Vertex RCS Platform can be integrated with CRM systems, marketing automation tools, customer support platforms, and other business applications to enable automated messaging workflows.",
