        rawText: "Tagline for WhatsApp Marketing\n\nConversations that swipe right on ROI\nBuild Lasting Connections & Higher ROI with WhatsApp Marketing Automation.\nAutomate campaigns, send personalized messages and grow your business with the world’s most powerful messaging platform.\n\nCTA Buttons:\n👉 Start Free Trial | 👉 Book a Demo\n\nWhy Choose WhatsApp Marketing?\nWhatsApp offers direct, personal and instant engagement with the highest open rates in marketing. Every message becomes a touchpoint to engage, nurture and convert. \n\nEngage\n[Images]\n\nDescription:\nEngage travellers by sharing curated packages, itineraries and exclusive offers directly on WhatsApp. With the WhatsApp Business API, hospitality brands deliver instant, personalized information that reduces customer effort and maximizes first impressions. \nA resort can engage new guests more effectively by:\n•\tBuild trust with pre-designed itineraries like 3 Nights, 4 Days – Goa Experience delivered instantly in chat.\n•\tReduce friction by offering interactive lists and quick-reply buttons such as View Packages, Download Itinerary, Check Price.\n•\tMaximize engagement with rich media carousels showcasing rooms, dining and experiences.\n•\tHighlight convenience with AI-powered chat support for FAQs like inclusions, check-in, or local attractions.\n\nNurture\n[Images]\n\nDescription:\nNurture customer relationships by providing timely recommendations, reminders and personalized offers through WhatsApp. With the Business API, brands guide buyers through their journey reducing drop-offs and maximizing repeat engagement.\n\nAn online fashion store can nurture shoppers by:\n•\tBuild stronger loyalty with abandoned cart reminders that re-engage customers instantly.\n•\tReduce lost sales with personalized product suggestions based on browsing history.\n•\tMaximize retention by sending automated reorder alerts, size guides, or style tips.\n•\tHighlight exclusivity through limited-time offers, seasonal discounts and loyalty rewards all inside WhatsApp.\n\nConvert\n[Images]\n\nDescription:\nConvert prospects into paying customers by enabling secure transactions, instant confirmations and seamless checkouts on WhatsApp. The Business API empowers brands to close deals faster while reducing friction and maximizing ROI.\nIndustry Example – Healthcare (Clinics & Labs):l\n\n\nA healthcare provider can convert patient inquiries into confirmed bookings by:\n•\tBuild confidence with automated appointment confirmations and digital receipts directly on WhatsApp.\n•\tReduce no-shows through timely reminders and pre-visit instructions.\n•\tMaximize patient convenience by enabling payments, lab test bookings and prescription refills within chat.\n•\tHighlight trust with secure, end-to-end encrypted communication for sensitive medical data.\n\nHeading /Tagline Options\nDrive Customers to WhatsApp from Every Channel\nGive your customers multiple ways to reach you- ads, QR codes, websites, or emails.\nEvery click or scan brings them directly into WhatsApp for instant engagement.\n[Images]\n\nKey Features\n[Images]\n\n\n•\t📩 Bulk Messaging: Send promotional offers, event invites and product updates to thousands of customers at once.\n•\t🎯 Personalization: Use customer names, order details, or dynamic fields to make every message feel personal.\n•\t⚡ Instant Delivery: Deliver messages in real time with high open rates (98%+).\n•\t🧩 Interactive Campaigns: Add buttons, lists and CTAs to drive engagement.\n•\t🔄 Automation: Schedule broadcasts, set recurring reminders and run drip campaigns.\n•\t📊 Analytics Dashboard: Track delivery, read rates and conversion performance.\n\nHeading \nHow to Use WhatsApp Marketing Effectively\nDescription (2–3 liner):\nExperience complete marketing control with Vertex Suite’s WhatsApp Broadcasting Dashboard. Plan and launch targeted campaigns, track performance in real time and identify which audiences to nurture or retain all from one unified platform.\nHere’s What You Can Do\n•\tPlan & Launch Campaigns\nCreate segmented WhatsApp broadcasts using dynamic templates and audience filters for personalized outreach.\n•\tTrack & Analyze Performance\nMonitor message deliveries, open rates and click-throughs through a detailed analytics dashboard to understand what works.\n•\tGenerate & Qualify Leads\nCapture new leads directly from replies and assign them to your sales or CRM pipelines automatically.\n•\tLifecycle Marketing Simplified\nBuild automated drip campaigns to re-engage inactive users and convert new leads into loyal customers.\n•\tRetention & Re-Engagement\nIdentify customers who haven’t interacted recently and send personalized offers, feedback requests, or loyalty updates to retain them.",
