            sourceTitle: "Tagline for WhatsApp chatbot",
            rawText: "Tagline for WhatsApp chatbot\n\nBring automation, intelligence and instant service to your business on WhatsApp.\nOr\nScale customer conversations instantly with a smart WhatsApp chatbot\nMicro-Description\nHandle thousands of customer interactions with a chatbot that can answer, route and execute actions inside WhatsApp - keeping your operations fast, efficient and always available.\nBEFORE vs AFTER CHATBOT (Problem → Solution Block) Images\nVisually:\n| BEFORE | AFTER |\nBEFORE WhatsApp Chatbot (The Problems)\nThis column highlights REAL business pains:\n•\tDelayed responses during peak hours\n•\tHigh dependency on human agents\n•\tCustomers waiting for answers\n•\tRepetitive queries consuming time\n•\tLeads dropping due to slow follow-ups\n•\tNo tracking of conversations\n•\tNo 24/7 availability\n•\tManual data collection (forms, screenshots, notes)\nNo need to make paragraphs  -  keep it crisp, brutal, real.\n\n🟩 AFTER WhatsApp Chatbot (The Transformation)\nThis column shows how the solution fixes everything:\n•\tInstant answers to common questions\n•\tAutomated customer journeys\n•\tSmart routing to departments or agents\n•\tLead qualification done automatically\n•\tZero delays in replies\n•\t24/7 availability\n•\tClean, structured data captured directly in chat\n•\tConsistent, error-free responses\n\nEnding line of a difference content\nA WhatsApp chatbot doesn’t just automate chat  -  it fixes the broken parts of your customer experience.\n\nNext heading\nWhat Your WhatsApp Chatbot is Built to do\n1.\tANSWER  -  Instant, Reliable Customer Responses\nDeliver fast, consistent answers to customer questions without relying on human availability. Your chatbot becomes the first line of support, resolving high-volume queries with accuracy.\nHighlights:\n•\tUnderstands and responds to voice notes just like text\n•\tBlends AI + rule-based logic for precise, context-aware replies\n•\tSupports rich message formats  -  buttons, lists, images, PDFs, videos\n\n\n2.\tGUIDE  -  Interactive Journeys That Simplify Decisions\nTurn complex customer interactions into guided steps. Buttons, menus and structured flows help users find exactly what they need - without confusion or back-and-forth.\nHighlights:\n•\tOpen websites, forms, demos or documents using in-chat webview\n•\tUse branching, conditions and logic to shape personalized journeys\n•\tBuild journeys visually using a drag-and-drop editor\n\n\n3.\tASSIST  -  Help Users Complete Tasks Inside WhatsApp\nFrom booking appointments to tracking orders, your chatbot lets customers finish tasks instantly - without leaving WhatsApp or waiting for an agent.\nHighlights:\n•\tHandle bookings, orders, ticket creation and status updates\n•\tCapture clean, structured data for CRM and backend systems\n•\tTrigger actions based on user responses or pre-set rules\n\n\n4.\tAUTOMATE  -  Processes That Run Without Human Effort\nEliminate repetitive manual work with smart automation. Your chatbot takes care of follow-ups, routing, reminders and escalations so your team can focus on what truly matters.\nHighlights:\n•\tAuto-assign leads/queries to the right team based on conditions\n•\tSend scheduled follow-ups, reminders and notifications\n•\tSeamlessly switch to human agents for complex cases with full context\n\nLast heading of this section\nFrom setup to automation  -  everything happens inside one platform.\nOr\nLaunch your WhatsApp chatbot in three simple steps.\n1. Train Your Chatbot\nAdd your FAQs, product details, workflows and business rules.\nYour chatbot learns your knowledge and understands how conversations should flow.\n2. Build Journeys Visually\nUse drag-and-drop blocks to create steps, conditions, menus, automations and responses.\nNo coding  -  publish flows in minutes.\n\n3. Deploy on WhatsApp\nConnect it to your WhatsApp Business API and go live instantly.\nYour chatbot begins answering, guiding and assisting customers 24/7.",
