            sourceTitle: "Tagline for WhatsApp Button",
            rawText: "Tagline for WhatsApp Button\n\nOne button that captures more leads than your entire website\nMicro-Description\nGive customers an instant route into your WhatsApp chatbot. One button does the work of multiple pages by capturing leads, answering questions and starting conversations right away.\n\nNext heading\nWhere You Can Place a WhatsApp Button\nYou can place the WhatsApp Button anywhere your customers interact with your business:\nOr\nWherever your customer sees your brand, a WhatsApp button can exist  - \nand every placement increases engagement and conversions.\n•\tWebsite (header, home page, product pages, Pricing Page, Checkout, floating button)\n•\t“Chat on WhatsApp”\n•\t“Book on WhatsApp”\n•\t“Order on WhatsApp”\n•\t“Talk to an Expert on WhatsApp”\n•\t\"Need help? WhatsApp us\"\n\n\n•\tMobile apps (support, sales, Order tracking)\n•\tSocial media (Instagram, Facebook, Ads)\n•\tSwipe-up / Button linked to WhatsApp\n•\tAds with “Click to WhatsApp”\n•\tSend WhatsApp Message- Call-to-Action Button\n•\tDigital marketing (email, SMS, Google Ads)\n•\tOffline (QR codes on storefronts, Brochures, packaging, bills, brochures, standees)\n•\tBusiness docs (PDFs, invoices, quotes, catalogs, Proposals)\n•\tE-commerce (product pages, checkout, tracking)\n•\tEvents & physical locations (tables, banners, kiosks)\n•\tQR code on table → order on WhatsApp.\n•\tQR code for:\n•\tAppointment booking\n•\tReports\n•\tConsultation\nNext heading\nWhy Businesses Choose the WhatsApp Button\nOne small button. Big impact on conversions, engagement and customer experience.\n1. Reduce Drop-Offs\nVisitors no longer have to search for your contact details or fill long forms.\nA WhatsApp Button gives them an instant way to connect before they leave the page.\n\n2. Capture High-Intent Leads\nPeople who click the button are already engaged, they want answers.\nThis creates stronger, more qualified leads compared to traditional forms.\n\n3. Provide Instant Support\nCustomers get real-time answers through your WhatsApp chatbot or team,\nresulting in faster resolutions and fewer lost opportunities.\n\n4. Improve Customer Experience\nInstead of navigating multiple pages, users get one simple route: tap → chat.\nIt feels natural, effortless and aligned with how most customers already communicate.\n\n5. Boost Conversions Across All Channels\nWhether it’s your website, app, landing page, email, or QR…\none WhatsApp Button increases engagement wherever you place it.\n\n6. Connect Users Directly to Automation\nRoute users to automated flows, FAQs, forms, or lead journeys instantly.\nYour operations become smoother, faster and more efficient.\n\nNext Heading\nWhat Happens After a User Clicks the Button\nEvery button click becomes the start of a structured WhatsApp journey - your chatbot replies instantly, workflows run in the background and customer data is captured automatically.\n\n1. Your Chatbot Greets & Assists Immediately\nThe customer is welcomed by your WhatsApp chatbot, not a blank screen.\nIt starts the conversation with:\n•\tinstant replies\n•\tFAQs\n•\tlead/questions capture\n•\trecommended options (menus, quick replies, lists)\nThis makes the experience feel guided and intelligent.\n\n2. User Is Routed Automatically Based on Intent\nDepending on what they type or choose, your system decides:\n•\tShould the user go to sales?\n•\tShould it be a support query?\n•\tShould they see a pricing flow?\n•\tShould they enter a lead form?\n•\tShould they check order status?\nRouting happens silently in the background.\n\n3. Your Workflows Trigger Behind the Scenes\nOnce the user interacts, your connected workflows can:\n•\tcreate a CRM lead\n•\tassign to a team member\n•\topen a ticket\n•\tfetch internal data via API\n•\tstart a WhatsApp Flow (e.g., forms, surveys, bookings)\n•\trun automations or send follow-ups\nThis turns the simple button into a complete process starter.\n\n4. Data Gets Captured Automatically\nEvery chat is logged automatically:\n•\tName\n•\tNumber\n•\tMessage\n•\tChat intent\n•\tLead category\n•\tSource (Website Button, App Button, etc.)\nYour CRM / dashboard receives structured data without manual entry.\n\n5. Human Takeover When Needed\nIf the user needs real assistance, the conversation is transferred to an agent with full context  -  no repetition, no confusion.\n\n6. Follow-Ups Are Sent Automatically\nBased on actions, your system can send:\n•\treminders\n•\toffers\n•\tupdates\n•\tdocuments\n•\tpayment links\n•\tstatus notifications\nThis keeps your engagement loop alive long after the button click.\n\nSmall Closing Line (High Impact)\nA simple click triggers an entire automated journey- powered by your chatbot, workflows and CRM.\nNext heading\nTypes of WhatsApp Buttons You Can Create\nChoose the entry point that fits your website, app, campaign, or customer journey.\na) Reply Buttons (Quick Replies)\nb) Call-to-Action URL Button\nc) Call Button (WhatsApp Call / Phone Call)\nd) Copy Code Button\ne) WhatsApp QR Button\n\nlast heading of the section-\nIntegrations & System Connectivity\nOr\nConnect the WhatsApp Button to Your Entire System\nEvery click becomes a trackable lead, a guided chat and an automated workflow.\n1. Chatbot Integration\nButton → Opens chat → Chatbot greets → Starts flow.\n2. CRM Integration\nData captured → Auto-created lead record.\n3. Workflow Automation\nAssign, route, follow-up → backend actions.\n4. Team Inbox\nView conversations, takeover anytime.\n5. Analytics & Reports\nMonitor clicks, leads, conversions.\n\n1. Chatbot Integration\nA click instantly opens a WhatsApp chat where your chatbot takes over.\nIt welcomes the user, asks the right questions, guides them through options and handles common queries without human effort.\n\n2. CRM Integration\nEvery conversation is logged automatically.\nLead information, chat history, user intent and source (“Website Button”, “Landing Page Button”, etc.) sync directly into your CRM  -  clean, structured and error-free.\n\n3. Workflow & Automation Integration\nBehind every button tap, your workflows activate silently:\n•\tAssign leads to the right team\n•\tTrigger ticket creation\n•\tSend follow-ups or reminders\n•\tStart WhatsApp Flows (forms, bookings, surveys)\n•\tFetch data via API\n•\tUpdate internal systems\nYour operations keep moving even when your team is offline.\n\n4. Team Inbox / Human Handover\nIf a real person is needed, your agents can jump into the conversation instantly.\nThe full context  -  user messages, clicked buttons, collected data  -  is already visible, so no customer has to repeat themselves.\n\n5. Analytics & Performance Tracking\nTrack how your WhatsApp Buttons perform across pages and channels:\n•\tClick-through rate\n•\tChats started\n•\tLeads generated\n•\tConversion outcomes\n•\tTop entry points\n•\tDrop-off analysis\nThis helps you optimise placement and messaging to maximise engagement.\n\n6. Multi-Channel Sync\nWhether the user came from a website, landing page, QR code, or email, all conversations flow into one unified system  -  making lead management simple and efficient.\n\nThe WhatsApp Button isn’t just a chat trigger  -  it becomes the entry point to your entire automation ecosystem.\n\n“Add your first WhatsApp Button today.”",
