            rawText: "Tagline for Click-to-WhatsApp Ads\n\nLaunch ads that start conversations  -  not website bounces.\nRemove the extra steps between ad click and customer interaction. With Click-to-WhatsApp Ads, users enter a chat instantly  -  improving response rates and accelerating conversions.\nNext Heading\n[All industry-based images]\nWhere Click-to-WhatsApp Ads Are Used\nPerfect for every moment where faster conversations create better conversions.\n1. Lead Generation Campaigns\nRun Meta ads that bring prospects straight into WhatsAp, skipping slow forms and boosting lead volume instantly.\n\n2. Product Enquiries & Catalog Exploration\nSend shoppers directly to WhatsApp to browse products, ask questions, compare items, or get personalised recommendations.\n\n3. Service Enquiries & Appointment Booking\nIdeal for salons, clinics, coaching institutes, real estate and automotive. Users tap → land in WhatsApp → book instantly.\n\n4. High-Intent Sales Campaigns\nTurn ad traffic into real conversations for consultations, demos, pricing queries and sales follow-ups  -  without website drop-offs.\n\n5. Customer Support & Query Handling\nSend users from ads to a WhatsApp chatbot/agent for FAQs, policy info, troubleshooting, or issue resolution.\n\n6. Event, Webinar & Program Signups\nDrive registrations by routing users to WhatsApp where they can sign up, ask details and receive reminders instantly.\n\n7. Travel, Hospitality & Tourism Promotions\nPerfect for enquiries like packages, itineraries, availability, booking support and real-time travel assistance.\n\n8. Government & PSU Citizen Services\nUse CTWA to route citizens from public service announcements directly into WhatsApp-based helpdesks, verification bots, or info support.\nShort section closer\nAny campaign that needs fast engagement and fewer drop-offs performs better with Click-to-WhatsApp Ads.\nNext Heading\nWhy Click-to-WhatsApp Ads Work So Well\nBecause conversations convert better than landing pages.\n1. Higher Conversion Rates\nUsers move from ad → chat instantly, eliminating drop-offs that normally happen on websites or forms.\n\n2. Faster Lead Qualification\nYour bot or team can ask questions, segment users and identify high-intent leads within seconds.\n\n3. Personalised Customer Experience\nInstead of sending users to a generic page, every interaction becomes a tailored, chat-based journey.\n\n4. Lower Cost Per Lead (CPL)\nWith fewer steps, less friction and more replies, your Meta ads deliver more leads at a lower cost.\n\n5. Stronger Engagement & Response Rates\nCustomers reply faster on WhatsApp because it’s familiar, convenient and always open.\n\n6. Instant Sales Opportunities\nHigh-intent users can chat, ask for pricing, negotiate, share documents, or complete payments immediately.\n\n7. Works for Every Industry\nE-commerce, real estate, healthcare, education, events, automotive, travel, government  -  CTWA adapts to all sectors.\n\nShort section closer\nCTWA converts attention into conversations  -  and conversations into revenue.\n\nOptional\nIndustry Snapshots: How Businesses Use Click-to-WhatsApp Ads\nReal examples that show how a single tap turns into real revenue.\n\n1. E-Commerce & D2C\nUse Case: Product enquiries, size recommendations, COD confirmations, abandoned cart recovery.\nOutcome: Faster decisions, fewer drop-offs, higher conversion rates directly from ads.\n\n2. Real Estate\nUse Case: Project enquiries, site visit bookings, pricing requests, brochure downloads.\nOutcome: High-intent leads routed instantly to sales with full conversation context.\n\n3. Travel & Hospitality\nUse Case: Package enquiries, itinerary personalisation, hotel availability checks, booking support.\nOutcome: Faster conversions because travellers prefer instant chat over long forms.\n\n4. Healthcare & Clinics\nUse Case: Appointment booking, consultation queries, treatment details, cost estimates.\nOutcome: Higher patient engagement and reduced call-centre load.\n\n5. Education & Coaching\nUse Case: Course enquiries, brochure sharing, demo class bookings, scholarship info.\nOutcome: Students convert faster when guided through WhatsApp conversations.\n6. Government & Public Services\nUse Case: Citizen support desks, scheme enquiries, verification assistance, public notifications.\nOutcome: High-volume citizen engagement handled efficiently through automated chat workflows.\n\n7. Automotive (Cars & Two-Wheelers)\nUse Case: Test drive bookings, model comparisons, price quotes, insurance/loan assistance.\nOutcome: Sales-ready leads routed directly to dealership teams.\n\n8. BFSI (Banking, Insurance, Fintech)\nUse Case: Policy enquiries, loan eligibility checks, account support, EMI reminders.\nOutcome: Faster prospect qualification + improved customer support.\nSection closer\nEvery industry benefits from ads that skip friction and open WhatsApp instantly  -  because conversations close faster than clicks.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nVertex Suite",
